{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團aespa的中國籍成員Ningning日前在美國出席「加州當代藝術博物館」（LACMA）舉辦的電影與藝術慈善晚宴，她昨日透過社交網分享在加州拍攝的照片，相中她以淡妝示人，穿上白色小背心和短裙在戶外曬太陽，她又坐在可見欣賞加州風景</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.394454+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:02:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"5ced41d3a4efe9bd849b5e604cbac5eb3cd665e40185d68526e9ab89e32e4e82","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}